    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/3efb956f728d298f1384fe637d8f4437.poster.avif?t=1746137639\" width=718 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/3efb956f728d298f1384fe637d8f4437.webm?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/3efb956f728d298f1384fe637d8f4437.mp4?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOODS (Niche Operators Orchestrating Desktop Shenanigans) are lil digital buddies that hang out on your desktop, helping you focus on your work and resist the siren call of procrastination. They come with a bunch of tools for maintaining a positive and healthy work environment everywhere from your home PC to your work laptop, while always saving room to have some fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Niche Operators</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/a35ac60001006f083debe1d290e3481d.poster.avif?t=1746137639\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/a35ac60001006f083debe1d290e3481d.webm?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/a35ac60001006f083debe1d290e3481d.mp4?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first official release features raccoon gamer girl Lily, hand-animated in a charming pixel style and hell bent on keeping you company as you go about your daily computer tasks. As multiple characters are released, you will be able to switch between Operators with the look, personality, and habits best suited for the task at hand. In later releases, we aim to make a tool to allow you to create your <i>own</i> Operator from scratch. Cool, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Stay Focused</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/53bbdd88bcfc4ed6c0ae6ed5a519f9f6.poster.avif?t=1746137639\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/53bbdd88bcfc4ed6c0ae6ed5a519f9f6.webm?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/53bbdd88bcfc4ed6c0ae6ed5a519f9f6.mp4?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part idle clicker, part virtual buddy, this niche operator has many useful abilities; timers, schedules, window features, (and more to come!) so keep an eye out for upcoming releases. Designed to keep you focused and facilitate your real-life tasks, your Operator is just the right balance of subtle and functional to provide what you need; no more opening multiple pomodoro timers and schedule apps to stay on track; it\u2019s all here. Simple n\u2019 sweet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>A Little Spice</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t get away with slacking on your Operator\u2019s watch: if left to her own devices, Lily has been known to get in a bit of trouble now and again. Keep your important windows out of her reach, and let her help you stay productive! Or else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-Do Lists (Checklists)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pomodoro Timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screenshots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stopwatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baseline Lily shenanigans (including window theft)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden minigame(s)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original sounds &amp; music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio &amp; Graphics settings and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated feedback &amp; bug reporting</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/3efb956f728d298f1384fe637d8f4437.poster.avif?t=1746137639\" width=718 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/3efb956f728d298f1384fe637d8f4437.webm?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/3efb956f728d298f1384fe637d8f4437.mp4?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOODS (Niche Operators Orchestrating Desktop Shenanigans) are lil digital buddies that hang out on your desktop, helping you focus on your work and resist the siren call of procrastination. They come with a bunch of tools for maintaining a positive and healthy work environment everywhere from your home PC to your work laptop, while always saving room to have some fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Niche Operators</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/a35ac60001006f083debe1d290e3481d.poster.avif?t=1746137639\" width=800 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/a35ac60001006f083debe1d290e3481d.webm?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388690/extras/a35ac60001006f083debe1d290e3481d.mp4?t=1746137639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first official release features raccoon gamer girl Lily, hand-animated in a charming pixel style and hell bent on keeping you company as you go 