ures</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To-Do Lists (Checklists)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pomodoro Timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screenshots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stopwatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alarms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Window destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baseline Lily shenanigans (including window theft)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden minigame(s)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original sounds &amp; music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio &amp; Graphics settings and customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated feedback &amp; bug reporting</p></li></ul>",
